# Smooth ship launch (design/303)

- Deploy with `scripts/ship_cloud_pair.ps1`. It pushes `origin main` when that is a fast-forward of HEAD. Do not start a second ship after a "push first" refusal if the script can push. Do not force-push.
- Build the APK with `scripts/build_release_apk.ps1`. It sets `ProgramFiles(x86)` before flutter. Do not assign `$env:ProgramFiles(x86)`.
- Run Python tests with `scripts/pytest.cmd`. Do not run bare `python -m pytest` from a shell whose `PYTHONPATH` can see another checkout.
